SUMMARY:Mugmorial Day w/ The Mug Band
DESCRIPTION:The Mug BandMugmorial Day 2026Monday May 25 – 3pmPisgah Brewing Indoor Stage–Spend Memorial Day with us at Pisgah Brewing for our 3rd annual Mugmorial Day! The Mug Band kicks off at 3pm.. keep one foot in the blues. \n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom & deli\, with live music several days a week\, plus an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/mugmorial-day-w-the-mug-band/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
