SUMMARY:Welcome to Summer Party! | Memorial Day
DESCRIPTION: ¡Bienvenidos al Verano fiesta en Hemingway’s Cuba! | 3rd Annual Welcome to Summer Party at Hemingway’s Cuba!\n\nHola locals\, it’s time to kick off summer the right way… rooftop views\, tropical cocktails\, and a dance floor that doesn’t quit. Join us at Hemingway’s Cuba as we turn up the heat with music by DJ MTN Vibez and a full evening of bachata\, brought to you in partnership with our friends at Bachata Asheville.\n\nMon\, May 25th – Memorial Day4:30 – Until it’s gone! Complimentary Tapas Tasting5:30 – 6:30 PM Free Bachata Lesson with Bachata Asheville6:30 – 9:30 PM Bachata Social + DJ MTN Vibez\n\n“Locals Only” 20% discount with a VIP Locals Card\, available at the host stand before the event and day of. (Also good for 10% off the rest of the year!)\nGood music\, strong drinks\, and just enough sunset to make you forget what day it is.\n  \nWe pair traditional Cuban cuisine with Asheville flair to deliver an experience that keeps you coming back for more. With the stunning panoramic views of the beautiful Blue Ridge Mountains\, Hemingway’s Cuba has been recognized as the Best Restaurant with a view for years and is a favorite Asheville restaurant and rooftop bar for visitors and locals alike. hemingwayscuba.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/welcome-to-summer-party-memorial-day/
LOCATION:Hemingway’s Cuba Asheville\, 15 Page Avenue\, 4th Floor\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/688728749_1687972399527198_58480203608894822_n-e1779270675422.jpg
GEO:35.5953573;-82.5558723
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Hemingway’s Cuba Asheville 15 Page Avenue 4th Floor Asheville NC 28801 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=15 Page Avenue\, 4th Floor:geo:-82.5558723,35.5953573
END:VEVENT
